\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {23}{\ignorespaces Bulk OCR to LLM-processing flow diagram. This figure visualizes the operational path from file intake, OCR expansion, and page storage to provider-specific ESG extraction and downstream ClimateBERT comparison outputs.}}{81}{figure.caption.38}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {24}{\ignorespaces Bulk OCR to ClimateBERT sequence diagram. This figure shows the interaction order between the user, OCR storage, LLM processing, provider backends, ESG record storage, and the downstream ClimateBERT comparison stage.}}{82}{figure.caption.39}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {25}{\ignorespaces Appendix workflow from Bulk OCR to page-range-based LLM extraction and downstream ClimateBERT processing. The implemented flow begins with OCR expansion, continues with provider-specific ESG extraction over selected page ranges, and ends with ClimateBERT comparison over the extracted text layer.}}{83}{figure.caption.40}%
